   "locked": false,
   "text": "Seed banner (until the data manager accepts it): \"Master data seeded on <date> from the DWH dimension exports. <n> findings to review.\"   [Open seed report] [Accept seed]\n(data manager)\nSeed report: table per dimension - rows per source (DWH view, dEPM export, seed), rows only in one source, attributes merged, values trimmed or re-encoded (DQ-10), fold and\nmerge result (DQ-36). Planning BOM: not seeded: no source (U9); price table and FX rates: not seeded: no source; Region Model Assignment and SOP / EOP: seeded from Parameter\ntable.xlsx (U11) once the cube is exported.",
   "originalText": "Seed banner (until the data manager accepts it): \"Master data seeded on <date> from the DWH dimension exports. <n> findings to review.\"   [Open seed report] [Accept seed]\n(data manager)\nSeed report: table per dimension - rows per source (DWH view, dEPM export, seed), rows only in one source, attributes merged, values trimmed or re-encoded (DQ-10), fold and\nmerge result (DQ-36). Planning BOM: not seeded: no source (U9); price table and FX rates: not seeded: no source; Region Model Assignment and SOP / EOP: seeded from Parameter\ntable.xlsx (U11) once the cube is exported.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
